# Repairo Provider

Flutter **technician/provider** app (`repairo_provider`). API base: `https://repairo.icu/api` via `AppConstants` in `lib/core/constants/app_constants.dart`.

## Layout

- `lib/presentation/` — screens & widgets (no raw `http` calls; use cubit → repository)
- `lib/business_logic/` — Cubits/Blocs (`flutter_bloc`)
- `lib/data/` — models, repositories, web_services
- `lib/core/` — constants, config, services (Firebase, Pusher)
- `lib/app_router.dart` — named routes for top-level flows
- `lib/main.dart` — `GetMaterialApp`, Firebase init, `RepairoProviderApp`

## Stack

GetX navigation (`Get.to`, `Get.toNamed`) + `AppRouter.generateRoute`. State: **Cubit/Bloc**. HTTP: mostly `package:http` (some Dio). Realtime chat: Pusher. Maps: flutter_map. Locale: ar/en, Cairo/Google Fonts.

## Do not

- Add files named `* copy.dart` or duplicate screen classes
- Register routes only in one place: extend `AppRouter` for `pushNamed`/`Get.toNamed` strings
- Introduce a second API base config without wiring `AppConfig.init()` in `main()`
- Use `BreakingBadApp` or placeholder class names for the root widget

## Canonical screens

- Subscription plans UI: `subscriptions_screen.dart` → `SubscriptionPlansScreen` (StatefulWidget)
- Legacy/unused bloc-based plans UI: `subscription_plans_screen.dart` → `LegacySubscriptionPlansView` (do not import for new features)
- Chat: `chatting_screen.dart` only (not a copy file)

## Active named routes (extend in `app_router.dart`)

`login`, `mainscreen`, `MultiStepProfileScreen`, `subscription_plans`, `verification`

Detail screens with IDs (request, chat, locations) use `Get.to(() => ...)` with `BlocProvider`, not named routes.
